    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Annota Line </i>is an interactive fiction about a train heist against the gods. Play as Serafin, an upstart gang leader in a decaying cyberpunk city, as she leads an unlikely team against the most powerful entities in every plane of existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this story that unfolds over three acts, you will:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a gang of troubled, charming characters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate rich environments with classic point-and-click controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a post-epidemic city ravaged by warring gangs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Untangle a web of drug-trafficking gods and profiteering politicians</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Annota Line </i>is an interactive fiction about a train heist against the gods. Play as Serafin, an upstart gang leader in a decaying cyberpunk city, as she leads an unlikely team against the most powerful entities in every plane of existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this story that unfolds over three acts, you will:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a gang of troubled, charming characters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate rich environments with classic point-and-click controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a post-epidemic city ravaged by warring gangs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Untangle a web of drug-trafficking gods and profiteering politicians</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the decaying cyberpunk city of Annota, where the gods are real and they hate you. Explore a post-epidemic city ravaged by warring gangs and untangle a web of drug-trafficking gods and profiteering politicians in this point-and-click narrative adventure.",
